wiigc-manager (1.0.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for Debian 13 (Trixie)
  * GTK4/libadwaita native application
  * Support for Wii and GameCube games management
  * Features include:
    - Game library with covers from GameTDB
    - Add, remove, convert games (ISO/WBFS)
    - Migrate and copy games between drives
    - Verify game integrity
    - Download homebrew from Open Shop Channel
    - Play games with Dolphin emulator
    - Animated banners and sound playback
  * Built on Wiimm's wit and wwt tools
  * Optimized for XFCE and other desktop environments

 -- WiiGC Manager Team <noreply@wiigcmanager.org>  Sat, 24 Oct 2026 15:00:00 +0000
